  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 32,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Oreck,\"",
        "line": 39
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 35,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nephoretti,\"",
        "line": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I need your help,\"",
        "line": 52
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 41,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can give you what was given to me. Speech. The ability to communicate beyond gestures. To speak as equals rather than master and slave, overseer and property.\"",
        "line": 56
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 43,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But it requires trust. Requires allowing me to touch your mind as the Nephoretti touched mine. And I know\u2014\"",
        "line": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 46,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is choice,\"",
        "line": 65
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 48,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"If you accept, we become brothers. Allies by choice rather than circumstance. And together, we claim what the Aeon Keepers prepared for humanity's liberation.\"",
        "line": 69
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I...\"",
        "line": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 87,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can speak,\"",
        "line": 125
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 88,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes,\"",
        "line": 127
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 90,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Why?\"",
        "line": 131
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 91,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Because,\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 93,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"There's armor waiting. Power the Aeon Keepers prepared. Dragon Mail infused with consciousness of being who sacrificed everything to circumvent laws that prevented direct intervention. But reaching it\u2014claiming it\u2014will require facing whatever guards it.\"",
        "line": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 94,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And I cannot do that alone.\"",
        "line": 139
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 96,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You ask me to fight beside you,\"",
        "line": 143
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 97,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Brother,\"",
        "line": 145
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 100,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Will you come with me? Will you help me claim what the Aeon Keepers prepared? Will you witness my transformation and ensure I remain myself despite power I'm about to receive?\"",
        "line": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 103,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I will come,\"",
        "line": 155
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 105,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Besides. Someone needs to ensure you don't do anything stupidly heroic and get yourself killed before this rebellion truly begins.\"",
        "line": 159
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 107,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then let's go claim my stupidly heroic armor and see if we survive the attempt.\"",
        "line": 163
      }
    }
  ],
